<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 156.55 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 156.55 mln rand S.Africa bonds Thur.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 156.55 million rand worth of South African bonds on Thursday after buying 211.99 million rand worth on Wednesday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
</text>
